        "message": "Task 66: P1 exam-format tracks - IELTS/TOEFL/C1 Advanced-style practice on the existing exam engine. lib/agent/exam-tracks.ts: per-track task-type mix + rubric briefs (C1A key-word transformations, TOEFL academic mini-texts in-item, IELTS opinion/trend/paraphrase), timing, default counts. Threaded: ExamSpec.track -> generateExam opts -> examSystem block (shares may override generic mix) -> prefixed titles -> grading attaches deterministic RANGE band reference (IELTS 0-9, TOEFL 0-120, Cambridge grades) with pct + not-an-official-score note; not-affiliated disclaimers in every track and the coach reply. Coach skill exam-track routes track keywords before the generic builder (battery-proven both ways). Honest limit recorded: format-faithful generated practice, no licensed papers. Gates: tsc 0, eslint 0, exam-track battery 42/42, main battery 413/413.",
